     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear All,<div><br></div><div>I have tried to run the stand count script on my orthomosaic with considering the shape size  0.8% of plot area counted i.e. mini. size = 0.8. </div><div>But according to above case there two issues : 1. miss-count of plant  2. Extra count.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"227\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:171pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n <col width=\"82\" style=\"width:62pt\">\r\n <col width=\"81\" style=\"width:61pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" width=\"64\" style=\"height:14.4pt;width:48pt;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">Range</td>\r\n  <td width=\"82\" style=\"width:62pt;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">Stand_Count</td>\r\n  <td width=\"81\" style=\"width:61pt;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">Actual count</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"19\" style=\"height:14.4pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"19\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:14.4pt;padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">25</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-alig