ite-space:nowrap\">150</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\" style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:none;white-space:nowrap\">148</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></table></div><div>How I can get actual stand count through it? </div><div> If anyone has suggestion regarding with above two issues kindly suggest me.</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve attached results and orthomosaic below</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div><div><br></div><div>Sudhir </div></div>\r\n"
